---
title: Invited Talks
---

<p>Nuria Oliver has delivered more than 300 invited talks to scientific,
government, industry, educational, and public audiences. Recordings of selected
talks are available <a href="https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=nuria+oliver">online</a>.</p>

<div class="talks-tools">
  <nav class="talks-jump" aria-label="Invited talks sections">
    {% for group in invitedTalks.recent %}<a href="#talks-{{ group.year }}">{{ group.year }}</a>{% endfor %}
    <a href="#historical-archive">Archive</a>
    <a href="#school-talks">Schools</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="talks-filter" role="search">
    <label class="visually-hidden" for="talks-query">Filter talks</label>
    <input id="talks-query" type="search" placeholder="Filter talks" autocomplete="off">
    <span id="talks-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 id="recent-talks">Recent invited talks</h2>

{% for group in invitedTalks.recent %}
<h3 id="talks-{{ group.year }}">{{ group.year }}</h3>
<ul>
  {% for talk in group.talks %}<li>{{ talk | markdownInline | safe }}</li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endfor %}

<h2 id="historical-archive">Historical archive</h2>

{% set archiveTypes = [
  { key: "government", title: "Government, universities, courses, and technology conferences" },
  { key: "public", title: "General public events" },
  { key: "scientific", title: "Scientific conferences and technical talks" }
] %}
{% for type in archiveTypes %}
<h3 id="archive-{{ type.key }}">{{ type.title }}</h3>
<div class="talks-type-content">
  {% for decade in invitedTalks.archive | archiveByDecade(type.key) %}
  <details class="talks-decade">
    <summary>{{ decade.decade }}s</summary>
    {% for year in decade.years %}
    <h5>{{ year.year }}</h5>
    <ul>
      {% for talk in year.talks %}<li>{{ talk | markdownInline | safe }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endfor %}
  </details>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endfor %}

<h2 id="school-talks">School and high school outreach</h2>
{% set schoolContent %}{% include "invited-talks-school.md" %}{% endset %}
{{ schoolContent | markdown | safe }}